  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Tectonic Fragdrill",
    "summary": "When an enemy unit ends a move of any kind within 8\" of one of your Cult Ambush markers and that marker would be removed as a result, you may instead move the marker to a spot that lies:\n\n- wholly within 8\" of the Tectonic Fragdrill\n- more than 8\" horizontally from every enemy unit\n\nIf no such spot exists, the marker is removed as usual.",
